msgid ""
"Your opponent is using pre-KDE4 version of KBattleship. Note that, according "
"to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed adjacent to one "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Dien Gegensmann bruukt en öller Verschoon vun KBattleship as för KDE4. "
"Beacht, dat sik de Scheep wegen de öller Regeln nich anröhren dörvt."

